Z||000006||bHooper||08-08-2000||06:49 PM||||Dude... no!  I'm just a stupid home mechanic, that has learned everything that he knows, in the past year... listening to youi guys  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>As for the coolant lasting... if i have to replace it next year, so be it.  By then (fingers crossed) I hope to be doing a 3.4 conversion.<P>Here goes... car is in the air.... gotta go to work!<P>Wish me luck and coolness for the next month and a half!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT||||reg||1
